          {
            
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Hey."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Hi. So I have this whole thing I need to say. Is it cool if I say it?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I've spent most of my life afraid... and unsure. I mean, even when you guys brought me back here, it didn't get better, it got worse because now I actually had something to lose."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "And it didn't help that it felt like you were avoiding me, keeping things from me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "And then I fought a dream demon. A creature who exists literally to make me live out my worst fears, and I thought, 'What have I been so afraid of?'"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "If you want to change your mind about being with me, change your mind."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "'Cause I'm gonna work that much harder to make you change it back."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "If you need to lie to keep dream demons from getting their claws on the urn, lie."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Keep secrets because you're burdened with all the responsibilities no one else can handle, all right then, keep your secrets."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "It is my job to bust my ass until you see me as someone to confide in."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I'm not gonna be afraid of losing you anymore, Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "'Cause I'm gonna be the guy who always fights to find you again."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E09-C08-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Sorry. I'm done."
          },
